i si aad u aragto faallooyinka bixiyay qiimeynta %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s waa ciwaanka iimaylka macmiilkayga','Code'=>'Koodh','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'%s gunnada ah marka uu macaamiil iibsado shati cusub.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Maaddaama aanu 30 maalmood u kaydinno lacag-celinta suurtagalka ah, waxaan bixinnaa oo keliya guddiyada ka da\'weyn 30 maalmood.','Communication'=>'Isgaarsiinta','Compatible up to'=>'La jaanqaadi kara ilaa','complete the opt-in'=>'dhammee is-diiwaangelinta','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Hambalyo','Never miss an important update'=>'Abid walba oo muhiim ah ha seegin','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay inaad u cusboonaysiisay %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Ku biir si aad u hesho ogeysiisyo iimayl oo ku saabsan cusboonaysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha, waxyaabo waxbarasho, iyo dalabyo mararka qaar, oo aad la wadaagto macluumaad guud oo ku saabsan deegaanka WordPress. Tani waxay naga caawinaysaa inaan %s ka dhigno mid si fiican ula jaanqaada bogaaga oo si wanaagsan u qabta waxa aad u baahan tahay.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Ku biir si aad u hesho ogeysiisyo iimayl oo ku saabsan cusboonaysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha, waxyaabo waxbarasho, iyo dalabyo mararka qaar, oo aad la wadaagto macluumaad guud oo ku saabsan deegaanka WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Haddii aad ka boodho arrintan, waa caadi! %1$s weli si fiican ayuu u shaqayn doonaa.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Waxaan soo bandhignay ikhtiyaarkan si aadan weligood u seegin warbixin muhiim ah oo aad nooga caawiso inaan ka dhigno %s mid si fiican ula jaanqaadaysa boggaaga oo si wanaagsan u qabaneysa waxaad uga baahan tahay.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Waan ku faraxsanahay inaan soo bandhigno is-dhexgalka Freemius ee heerka shabakadda.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Intii lagu guda jiray hawsha cusboonaysiinta waxaanu shabakadda ka dhex ogaanay %s goob(bo) oo weli u baahan in aad fiiro gaar ah u yeelato.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Inta lagu jiro howsha cusboonaysiinta waxaan ogaanay %d mareeg(yo) oo weli sugaya hawlgelinta shatiga.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaad isticmaasho %s ee bogaggaas, fadlan geli furahaaga ruqsadaha hoose oo guji badhanka hawlgelinta.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Haddii kale, waad iska dhaafi kartaa hadda oo aad shatiga hawlgelin kartaa hadhow, bogga Account ee %s ee heerka shabakadda.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Ku xidhan','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Marka aad dhammaysato, dami %s oo dib u daari.','Contact'=>'La xiriir','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Fadlan noo soo sheeg haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inay nagu soo xiriiraan cusboonaysiinta amniga & sifooyinka, waxyaabaha waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada marmarka qaarka ah:','Contact Support'=>'La xiriir Taageerada','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Waan ka xumahay dhibaatada soo gaartay, waana joognaa si aan ku caawino haddii aad na siiso fursad.','Contact Us'=>'Nala Xiriir','Please contact us here'=>'Fadlan nagala soo xiriir halkan','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Fadlan nagala soo xiriir fariintan soo socota:','Continue'=>'Sii wad','Contributors'=>'Ka-qaybgalayaasha','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Lama howlgelin karo %s.','Country'=>'Waddanka','Cron Type'=>'Nooca Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Waxaan isticmaalnaa maktabadda PHP cURL ee wicitaanada API, taas oo ah maktabad aad u caan ah oo badanaa la rakibo isla markaana shaqeysa iyada oo aan loo baahnayn habeyn dheeraad ah. Nasiib xumo, cURL kuma shaqeyno (ama waa la damiyay) adeerkaaga (server-kaaga).','data'=>'xogta','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'Habka khal-bixinta waa la hawlgeliyay si guul leh waxaana si otomaatig ah loo damin doonaa 60 daqiiqo gudahood. Waxaad sidoo kale damin kartaa horay adigoo gujinaya xiriiriyaha "Stop Debug".','Date'=>'Taariikhda','Deactivate'=>'Dami','Deactivate the free version'=>'Demiqa nooca bilaashka ah','Deactivate License'=>'Dami Shatliga','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Joojinta shatigaagu waxay xiri doontaa dhammaan sifooyinka qaaliga ah, laakiin waxay sahlaysaa in shatiga lagu hawlgeliyo goob kale. Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad sii wadato?','Deactivation'=>'Hawlgabnimada','Yes - %s'=>'Haa - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Gudbi & %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Joojinta ama ka saaridda %s waxay si toos ah u joojinaysaa shatiga, kaas oo aad ku isticmaali kartid degel kale.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Haddii aad waqti haysato, fadlan noo soo sheeg sababta aad u tahay %s','Debug Log'=>'Diiwaanka Cilmi-baaridda','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Cillad-bixinta','delegate'=>'Wakiil','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Haddii aad gujiso, go\'aankan waxaa loo xilsaari doonaa maamulayaasha mareegaha.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'U wakiil Maamulayaasha Site-ka','Delegate to Site Admins & Continue'=>'U wakiil Maamulayaasha Goobta & Sii wad','Delegating, please wait'=>'Waa la wakiilayaa, fadlan sug','verbDelete'=>'Tirtir','Delete All Accounts'=>'Tirtir Dhammaan Akoonnada','Are you sure you want to delete all Freemius data?'=>'Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad tirtirto dhammaan xogta Freemius?','Plugin installer section titleDescription'=>'Sharaxaadda','Details'=>'Macluumaad','seems like the key you entered doesn\'t match our records.'=>'waxaa u muuqata in furaha aad gelisay uusan waafaqsanayn diiwaankeena.','Diagnostic Info'=>'Macluumaadka Baaritaanka','Disabling white-label mode'=>'Joojinta habka calaamadda cad','Disconnect'=>'Go\'i','Are you sure you would like to proceed with the disconnection?'=>'Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad la sii waddo goynta?','If you wish to cancel your %1$s plan\'s subscription instead, please navigate to the %2$s and cancel it there.'=>'Haddii aad halkii ay ka ahaato doonaysid inaad joojiso rukumashada qorshahaaga %1$s, fadlan u soco %2$s oo halkaas ku jooji.','as close a windowDismiss'=>'Iska indha tir','do %1$sNOT%2$s send me security & feature updates, educational content and offers.'=>'ha %1$sHAA%2$s ii dirin ammaan & cusbooneysiin sifooyin, waxyaabo waxbarasho iyo dalabyo.','Enter the domain of your website or other websites from where you plan to promote the %s.'=>'Geli magaca domain-ka mareegtaada ama mareegaha kale 