tinue using the %3$s without interruptions.'=>'Sanksiyankaagu waa dhacay. %1$sHadda cusboonaysii%2$s si aad si aan kala go\' lahayn ugu sii isticmaasho %3$s.','Your license has expired. You can still continue using all the %s features, but you\'ll need to renew your license to continue getting updates and support.'=>'Satifkaagu waa dhacay. Waxaad weli isticmaali kartaa dhammaan sifooyinka %s, laakiin waxaad u baahan doontaa inaad cusboonaysiiso shatigaaga si aad u hesho wixii warar ah iyo taageero ah.','License ID'=>'Shatiye ID','License issues?'=>'Caqabadaha shatiga?','Single Site License'=>'Shati hal oo keliya','Unlimited Licenses'=>'Sannadaha aan xadka lahayn','Up to %s Sites'=>'Ilaa %s Goobood','Is this your client\'s site? %s if you wish to hide sensitive info like your email, license key, prices, billing address & invoices from the WP Admin.'=>'Ma kan ba waa mareegta macaamiishaada? %s haddii aad rabto inaad ka qarisid WP Admin macluumaadka xasaasiga ah sida iimaylkaaga, furaha shatiga, qiimaha, cinwaanka biilasha & qaansheegyada.','Your %1$s license was flagged as white-labeled to hide sensitive information from the WP Admin (e.g. your email, license key, prices, billing address & invoices). If you ever wish to revert it back, you can easily do it through your %2$s. If this was a mistake you can also %3$s.'=>'Shatiyadaada %1$s ayaa loo calaamadiyay in lagu calaamadiyay magacaaga si looga qariyo macluumaadka xasaasiga ah WP Admin (tusaale iimaylkaaga, furaha shatiga, qiimaha, cinwaanka biilasha & rasiidhada). Haddii aad waligaa rabto inaad dib ugu celiso, waxaad si sahal ah uga samayn kartaa %2$s adiga. Haddii tani ay ahayd qalad waxaad sidoo kale %3$s kartaa.','Lifetime'=>'Nolol-akhirsan','Load DB Option'=>'Shub Ikhtiyaarka DB','Localhost'=>'Localhost','Log'=>'Diiwaanka','Logger'=>'Kaydiyaha','Long-Term Duplicate'=>'Nuqul Waqti-dheer ah','Message'=>'Fariin','Method'=>'Habka','Migrate Options to Network'=>'U wareeji Xulashooyinka Shabakadda','Migrate'=>'Soo gu