day. Weli waad sii wadan kartaa isticmaalka dhammaan sifooyinkayaga bilaashka ah.','Your free trial has expired. %1$sUpgrade now%2$s to continue using the %3$s without interruptions.'=>'Tijaabadaadii bilaashka ahayd waa dhacday. %1$sHadda cusboonaysii%2$s si aad si aan kala go\' lahayn ugu sii isticmaasho %3$s.','Plan %s do not exist, therefore, can\'t start a trial.'=>'Qorshaha %s ma jiro, sida awgeed, lama bilaabi karo tijaabo.','Your trial has been successfully started.'=>'Tijaabadaadu waa si guul leh loo bilaabay.','You already utilized a trial before.'=>'Horay ayaad tijaabo u isticmaashay.','How do you like %1$s so far? Test all our %2$s premium features with a %3$d-day free trial.'=>'Sidee u jeceshahay %1$s ilaa iyo hadda? Tijaabi dhammaan sifooyinka %2$s ee qaaliga ah adiga oo isticmaalaya %3$d maalmood oo tijaabo ah oo bilaash ah.','Type'=>'Nooca','Unable to connect to the filesystem. Please confirm your credentials.'=>'Lama xiriiri karo nidaamka faylalka. Fadlan xaqiiji aqoonsigaaga.','There was an unexpected API error while processing your request. Please try again in a few minutes and if it still doesn\'t work, contact the %s\'s author with the following:'=>'Waxaa jiray khalad API ah oo lama filaan ah intii lagu guda jiray ka shaqaynta codsigaaga. Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqado gudahood haddii ay weli shaqayn weydana, kala xidhiidh qoraaga %s waxyaabaha soo socda:','Unexpected error, try again in 5 minutes. If the error persists, please contact support.'=>'Cilad aan la fileyn, fadlan 5 daqiiqo dib u day. Haddii ciladdu ay sii jirto, fadlan la xiriir taageerada.','Uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Uninstall-gareynta %s waxay si otomaatig ah u joojin doontaa ruqsadda, taas oo aad awood u yeelan doontaa inaad ka isticmaasho goob kale.','An unknown error has occurred.'=>'Waxaa dhacay qalad aan la aqoon.','Unlimited commissions.'=>'Komishanada aan xadidnayn.','Unlimited Updates'=>'Cusboonaysiin aan xadidnayn','verbUpdate'=>'Cusbooneysii','Would you like to proceed with the update?'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad ku sii waddo cusboonaysiinta?','Update'=>'Cusbooneysii','Update License'=>'Cusbooneysii Shatiga','Upgrade'=>'Cusbooneysii','Important Upgrade Notice:'=>'Ogeysiiska Cusboonaysiinta Muhiimka ah:','Upload and activate the downloaded version'=>'Soo rar oo shaqaysii noocan la soo degsay','User Dashboard'=>'Golaha Isticmaalaha','Sorry, we could not complete the email update. Another user with the same email is already registered.'=>'Waan ka xumnahay, ma aan badbaadin karin cusboonaysiinta iimeylka. Isticmaale kale oo wata iimeylkan oo kale ayaa horay u diiwaangashan.','If you would like to give up the ownership of the %1$s\'s account to %2$s click the Change Ownership button.'=>'Haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaad wareejiso lahaanshaha koontada %1$s ee ku aaddan %2$s, riix badhanka Beddelka Lahaanshaha.','User ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Isticmaalaha','User key'=>'Furaha isticmaalaha','Users'=>'Isticmaalayaasha','Value'=>'Qiime','Verification mail was just sent to %s. If you can\'t find it after 5 min, please check your spam box.'=>'Farriinta xaqiijinta waxaa hadda loo diray %s. Haddii aadan ka helin 5 daqiiqo ka dib, fadlan hubi sanduuqaaga spam-ka.','Verified'=>'La xaqiijiyay','Verify Email'=>'Xaqiiji Emailka','product versionVersion'=>'Nooc','Version %s was released.'=>'Nooca %s waa la soo saaray.','View details'=>'Eeg macluumaadka','Click to view full-size screenshot %d'=>'Guji si aad u aragto shaashadda oo buuxda %d','View paid features'=>'Eeg astaamaha la bixiyo','Warning'=>'Digniin','What is your %s?'=>'Waa maxay %s-kaagu?','Used to express elation, enthusiasm, or triumph (especially in electronic communication).W00t'=>'W00t','WordPress.org Plugin Page'=>'Bogga Barnaamij-ku-kordhinta ee WordPress.org','It seems like one of the authentication parameters is wrong. Update your Public Key, Secret Key & User ID, and try again.'=>'Waxaa u muuqata in mid ka mid ah xu