yaa dhacay intii lagu jiray isku dayga lagu dejinayay habka beta ee isticmaalaha.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Khalad aan la aqoon ayaa dhacay inta lagu guda jiray isku dayga lagu beddelayo habka calaamadda cad ee shatiga.','Annual'=>'Sanadle','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Markaad gujiso "Opt Out", %s ma awoodi doonto in ay sii aragto magacaaga iyo iibsigaaga.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Markaad gujiso "Ka bax", xogta ogaanshaha cilladaha mar dambe looma diri doono %s.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Marka laga jaro mareegta, xogta baaritaanka ee horay loo wadaagay ee ku saabsan %1$s waa la tirtiri doonaa mana sii muuqan doonto %2$s.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Adigoo ka doorbidaya in aanad xogtan la wadaagin server-ka cusboonaysiinta, waa inaad ka hubisaa sii-daymaha cusub ee %1$s oo aad gacanta ku soo dejisaa oo aad rakibtaa. Kaliya ma aha dhibaato, laakiin seegista cusboonaysiinta waxay gelin kartaa mareegtaada halis waxayna keeni kartaa dhibaatooyin waafaqsan oo aan loo baahnayn, markaa waxaan si xoog leh ugu talineynaa in la hayo ogolaanshaha muhiimka ah.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Jooji %1$s - Uma baahni mar dambe wax cusboonaysiin ah oo ku saabsan amniga & astaamaha, mana u baahni taageero ku saabsan %2$s sababta oo ah ma qorshaynayo inaan isticmaalo %3$s kan, ama degel kale midkoodna.','Cancel %s?'=>'Jooji %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Waa la joojiyaa %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Waa la joojiyaa %s...','Click here'=>'Halkan riix','Deactivating'=>'Joojinaya','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Joojinta xiriirka shabakadda waxay si joogto ah uga saari doontaa %s koontadaada Dashboardka Isticmaalaha.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Si loo helo amniga & casriyeynta sifooyinka si otomaatig ah, iyo maamulka & ilaalinta liisanka, %s wuxuu u baahan yahay inuu:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Si loo geeyo ammaan & cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, iyo maamulka shatiga, %s waxay u baahan tahay in','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius waa shatigayaga iyo matoorayada cusboonaysiinta barnaamijka','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Haddii tani ay tahay nuqul muddo dheer ah, si aad u ilaaliso cusboonaysiinta tooska ah iyo shaqaynta lacagta lagu bixiyo %1$s kadib, fadlan %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Ma %2$s ma nuqul baa ah %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Ku biir Barnaamijka Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Ku biir barnaamijka Beta','License'=>'Sannad-sharciga','License Key'=>'Furaha Sharciga','License key'=>'Sharciga rukhsadda','Monthly'=>'Bishii','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Magacyada, gaabisyada, noocyada, iyo haddii ay shaqeynayaan iyo inkale','New Version Available'=>'Nooca Cusub Waa La Heli Karaa','Optional'=>'Ikhtiyaari','Plan'=>'Qorshe','Products'=>'Alaabooyinka','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Wadaagista xogta ogaanshaha waxay gacan ka geysataa bixinta shaqooyin dheeraad ah oo khuseeya mareegtaada, ka fogaanshaha WordPress ama noocyada PHP ee aan is-waafaqayn ee jebin kara mareegta, iyo aqoonsiga luqadaha & gobollada ay tahay in %s loo turjumo laguna hagaajiyo.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Si aad u awooddo inaad dib u isticmaasho ruqsadda marka %s uusan mar dambe shaqaynayn.','Subscription'=>'Rukun-dhaqmeed','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s waxay si joogto ah ugu diri doontaa xogta ruqsadaha muhiimka ah %2$s si ay u hubiso amniga iyo cusboonaysiinta astaamaha, hamigana u xaqiijiso saxnaanta ruqsadadaada.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Waxaa jira %1$s oo ah %2$s oo la heli karo.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Si loo hubiyo waafaqidda loogana fogaado is-khilaafka plugins-kaaga iyo mawduucyadaada ku rakiban.','Trial'=>'Imtixaan','View %s State'=>'Eeg Xaaladda %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Arag macluumaadka guud ee %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Haa, %2$s waa nuqul ka mid ah %4$s ujeedada tijaabinta, marxaladda, ama horumarinta.','You have a %s license.'=>'Waxaad haysataa shati %s ah.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Waxaad iibsatay shati ah %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Waxa lagugu soo diri doonaa iimayl xaqiijin ah oo ku saabsan %1$s sanduuqaaga iimaylka ee %2$s. Fadlan hubi inaad gujiso badhanka ku jira iimaylkaas si aad u %3$s.','days'=>'maalmo','deactivating'=>'deminaya','hour'=>'saacad','hours'=>'saacadaha','license'=>'sharciga ruqhterska','optional'=>'ikhtiyaari ah','products'=>'alaabta','skip'=>'ka bood','subscription'=>'is-diiwaangelinta','trial'=>'tijaabo','Clone resolution a