 ka bilaabmayaa horgalahan, si uusan bogaggu u muujin kan dhisay. 1 ilaa 8 xaraf oo yar ama nambarro ah, oo ka bilaabmaya xaraf.','Save'=>'Keydi','Beta updates'=>'Cusbooneysiinaha Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Boggan wuxuu helayaa noocyada beta cusbooneysiin ahaan.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Boggan wuxuu helayaa noocyada xasiloon kaliya.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Tan kaga beddel bogga Koontada','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Noocyada Beta waxaa la siiyaa rakibaadaha Pro ee ruqseysan ee ku xiran akoonkooda. Marka la xiro, waxaad ka soo biiri kartaa bogga Akoonka.','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Codsiga lagu beddelayo qoraalkan ayaa istaagay intii uusan dhammaan, markaa qoraalkii waa la booday. Fur si aad u beddesho, ama mar labaad uga beddel halkan.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Ma jiro wax kayd ah oo qoraalkan ah oo la soo celiyo.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Waxka la beddelay lama keydin karo.','Unknown error.'=>'Khalad aan la aqoon.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Weli lama hubin wax nuxur ah oo hore.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'So celinta waxyaabihii hore: %1$d ee %2$d qoraal.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Beddelidda nuxurkii hore: %1$d oo ka mid ah %2$d qoraallo.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Dib-u-dejintii waa dhammaatay: %1$d waa la soo celiyay, %2$d waa ay fashilmeen.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Beddelidii waa dhammaatay: %1$d waa la beddelay, %2$d waa sidoodii, %3$d waa ay fashilmeen.','Legacy content'=>'Qoraalka hore','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Bogagga lagu sameeyay noocyadii hore ee Page Builder Sandwich waxaa loo beddelaa baloogag gadaasha dambe. Qoraal kasta waa la kaydiyaa marka hore, si beddelka kasta loo tirtiro karo.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'%d qoraal ayaa weli haya nuxurkii hore.' . "\0" . '%d qoraal ayaa weli xambaarsan waxyaabaha duugga ah.','%d post has a backup.'=>'%d qoraal waxay leedahay keyd.' . "\0" . '%d qoraal waxay leeyihiin keyd.','%d post could not be handled'=>'%d qoraal lama xakamayn karo' . "\0" . '%d qoraallo lama maamuli karin','Post %d'=>'Qoraalka %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Beddeliddu waa bilowday. Waxay ka socotaa gadaasha; waad ka bixi kartaa boggan.','Convert legacy content'=>'Beddel waxyaabaha duugga ah','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad u soo celiso dhammaan qoraalladii la beddelay qaabkoodii hore? Isbeddellada lagu sameeyay qoraalladaas wixii ka dambeeyay markii la beddelay waa la lixin doonaa.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Dib u celinta waa billowday. Waxay ka socotaa gadaal; waad ka bixi kartaa boggan.','Undo all conversions'=>'Gadaal u celi dhammaan beddelallada','Shortcode tag'=>'Astaamaha gaaban','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Isticmaal xarfaha, nambarada, xariijimaha iyo hoosta ka xarriiqaha kaliya.','Attribute name'=>'Magaca sifada','Add attribute'=>'Ku dar sifada','Content'=>'Muxuu ku jiraa','Shortcode'=>'Shortcode','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Ka dooro calaamadda gaaban goobaha baloogga.','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Kontoroolka "%s" ee tifaftiraha hore looga heli maayo tifaftiraha baloogga. Geli qiimaha sidoo kale qoraal ahaan.','Choose image'=>'Dooro sawirka','Choose file'=>'Xulo faylka','— Default —'=>'— Caadi ah —','Advanced styling'=>'Qaabeynta horumarsan','Inline CSS'=>'CSS-ka gudaha ah','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Go\'aannada CSS, tusaale ahaan: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Saamaynta (noocyadii hore)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Magacyada saamaynta ee bannaan-u-kala-baxsan ee laga soo qaaday noocyadii hore, tusaale ahaan: hover-shadow','Row'=>'Saf','Width'=>'Ballaca','Content width'=>'Ballaca nuxurka','Full width'=>'Ballac buuxa','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Ballac buuxa, nuxurka waxaa lagu hayaa dhexda','Link'=>'Isku xir','Link address'=>'Cinwaanka xiriirinta','Open in a new tab'=>'Ka fur tab cusub','Link relationship'=>'Xiriirka xiriirinta','Alignment'=>'Isku-dabarridda','None'=>'Midna','Left'=>'Bidix','Centre'=>'Xarunta','Right'=>'Midig','Button text'=>'Badhanka qoraalka','Add text…'=>'Ku dar qoraal…','Icon'=>'Icon','SVG markup'=>'Qoraalka SVG','Scripts, links and external references are removed before the icon is shown.'=>'Qoraallada, xiriiriyeyaasha iyo tixraacyada dibadda waa la tirtiraa intaan astaanta la soo bandhigin.','Accessible label'=>'Summaddu la heli karo','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Astaamaha qurxinta uga tag eber.','Paste SVG markup in the block settings.'=>'Ku dhaji astaanta SVG goobaha baloogga.','New setting name'=>'Magaca dejinta cusub','For example: title or text'=>'Tusaale ahaan: cinwaan ama qoraal','Add setting'=>'Ku dar habeyn','Widget'=>'Widget','Choose a widget'=>'Xulo qalab yar','Widget area'=>'Goobta widget-ka','Choose a widget area'=>'Dooro aagagga farmaajada','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Sawirkan ma laha ballac iyo dherer, sidaas darteed boggu wuu boodi doonaa marka uu soo hogo. Sii ka dooro Maktabadda Warbaahinta (Media Library), ama dhig ballaciisa iyo dhererkiisa.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Muuqaalkani kama iman Maktabadda Warbaahinta, markaa cabbirkiisu lama yaqaan oo boggu wuu boodi doonaa mark uu soo shubmayo. Beddelkeeda, geli Maktabadda Warbaahinta.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Muuqaal, fiiyo ama qaab ku jira HTML-kan malaha balac iyo dherer, marka boggu wuu boodayaa marka uu soo go\'ayo. Ku dar sifooyinka balaca iyo dhererka (width and height).','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Kani wuxuu iskaba beddelaa cabbirka marka uu soo shubo, taas oo dhaqaajisa waxyaabaha hoostiisa ku yaal. Sii boos ama dhig hoose ee bogga.','Layout shift'=>'Isbeddelka qaab-dhismeedka','Heading'=>'Madax','Text'=>'Qoraal','Style'=>'Habka','Plain'=>'Caadi','Accent'=>'Lamaanaha luqadda','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Ma jiraan luuqado la isku beddelayo. Beddeluhu wuxuu soo baxayaa marka qalabka turjumaaddu uu liis gareeyo laba ama in ka badan oo luuqadood.','Switcher'=>'Beddeleeyaha','Show the current language'=>'Muuji luqadda hadda taagan','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ku rakib Tranzly oo liis garee laba luqadood ama ka badan, isla markaana badalku wuxuu ka muuqanayaa halkan.','Design'=>'Naqshadee','List'=>'Liiska','Pills'=>'Kaabsado','Buttons'=>'Badhamada','Dropdown'=>'So-baxayaasha hoos u dhacaya','Language codes'=>'Koodhadhka luqadaha','Show each language as'=>'Muuji luqad kasta sida','Language name'=>'Magaca luqadda','Language code'=>'Farshaxanka luqadda','Name and code'=>'Magaca iyo sumadda','Flags'=>'Calanka','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Markaa uu demiyo: calanka waa dal, ee maaha luqad.','Include the current language'=>'Kadar luqadda hadda jirta','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Qari luqadaha boggan aan la turjumin','Stack vertically'=>'Isku xir saddex-xagal ah','Colours'=>'Midabada','Background'=>'Asalka','Current language text'=>'Luqadda hadda taagan','Current language background'=>'Haddda luqadda asaliga ah','Border'=>'Xudduud','Size and spacing'=>'Cabirka iyo booska','Corner radius'=>'Gacmeedka geeska','Space between languages'=>'Aabbaha luuqadaha u dhexeeya','Text size'=>'Cabbirka qoraalka','%s is also editing this page. Saving may overwrite their changes.'=>'%s sido kale waa ay/uu wax ka bedelayaa boggan. Keydintu waxayna tirtiri kartaa isbeddelladooda.','Block library'=>'Maktabadda xannibaadda','Layers'=>'Lakabado','Close panel'=>'Xir guddiga','Page canvas'=>'Bogga fanka','Revisions'=>'Dib-u-eegisyada','Block settings'=>'Dejinta xannibaadda','Add block: %s'=>'Kudar baloog: %s','(no title)'=>'(Cinwaan la\'aan)','Open in Studio: %s'=>'Ka fur Studio: %s','Undo'=>'Ka noqo','Redo'=>'Dib u samee','Show or hide layers'=>'Muuji ama qari lakabyada','Show or hide the block library'=>'Muuji ama qari maktabadda baloogga','Show revisions'=>'Muuji dib-u-eegisyada','Open the normal editor'=>'Fur tafatiraha caadiga ah','Keyboard shortcuts'=>'Gaaban-gaabyada kiiboodhka','Preview: desktop'=>'Horay u eeg: desktop-ka','Preview: tablet'=>'Horudhaca: tablet','Preview: mobile'=>'Horay u eeg: moobilka','Copy style of the selected block'=>'Nuqul ka qaado qaabka baloogga la doortay','Paste style onto the selected block'=>'Qaabka ku dheji xannibaadda la doortay','Copy the selected section'=>'Koobi qaybta la xushay','Paste a copied section'=>'Geli qayb la koobiyay','Turn off safe mode'=>'Dam modo amaanka','Turn on safe mode (other plugins off, for you, in Studio only)'=>'Daar habka nabdoon (plugins-ka kale waa dansan yihiin, adiga awgeed, Studio kaliya)','Published'=>'La daabacay','Scheduled'=>'Qorsheysan','Pending review'=>'Waxa la sugayaa dib u eegis','Private'=>'Gaar loo leeyahay','Draft'=>'Qabyo','All changes saved'=>'Dhammaan isbeddellada waa la kaydiyay','Saving…'=>'Kaydinaya…','Autosaving…'=>'Kaydinaya…','Unsaved changes'=>'Isbeddellada aan la kaydin','autosaved'=>'si toos ah loo keydiyey','Desktop preview'=>'Horudhaca desktop-ka','Tablet preview'=>'Horudhaca Kiniinka','Mobile preview'=>'Horudhaca mobaayilka','Studio toolbar'=>'Qalabka Studio','Back to the normal editor'=>'Ku noqo tafatiraha caadiga ah','Page title'=>'Cinwaanka bogga','Preview width'=>'Ballaca horudhaca','Command palette'=>'Baakadaha amarka','View page (opens in a new tab)'=>'Daawado bogga (waxaa lagu furayaa tab cusub)','Save draft'=>'Kaydi qabyada','Publish'=>'Daabac','Restore unsaved changes?'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad soo celiso isbeddellada aan la kaydin?','This page has changes that were never saved. They were kept in this browser:'=>'Boggan wuxuu leeyahay isbeddello aan weligood la keydin. Waxaa lagu hayay biraawsarkan:','This page has a newer autosave than the saved version:'=>'Boggan wuxuu leeyahay keydin cusub oo si otomaatig ah loo sameeyay marka loo eego nooca la keydiyay:','Restore unsaved changes'=>'Soceli isbeddellada aan la keydinin','Discard'=>'Basaal','Revisions could not be loaded.'=>'Dib-u-eegisyada lama soo dejin karo.','Revision restored. Save to keep it, or undo to go back.'=>'Dib-u-eegistii waa la soo celiyay. Kaydi si aad u hayso, ama ka noqo si aad dib ugu noqoto.','Close revisions'=>'Xir wax-ka-beddellada','No revisions yet. Each save makes one.'=>'Weli wax dib u eegis ah ma jiraan. Kaydin kastaa waxay samaysaa mid.','Revision from %s'=>'Dib-u-eegistii laga bilaabo %s','Restore this revision'=>'Soceli dib u eegistan','Safe mode could not be changed.'=>'Habka badbaadada lama beddeli karin.','Safe mode is on.'=>'Habka badbaadada waa shidhan yahay.','%d other plugin is switched off, for you and in Sandwich Studio only. The live site and other users are not affected.'=>'%dplugin kale ayaa dansan, adiga iyo Sandwich Studio keliya. Bogga tooska ah iyo isticmaaleyaasha kale ma saameyn doono.' . "\0" . '%d plugins kale waa la damiyay, adiga iyo Sandwich Studio keliya. Bogga tooska ah iyo isticmaaleyaasha kale ma saameynayo.','Safe mode: switch other plugins off in Studio, for you only'=>'Habka nabdoon: dami furayaasha kale ee Studio, adiga keligaa','Safe mode'=>'Habka badbaadada','Save your changes.'=>'Keydi isbeddelladaada.','Undo your last change.'=>'Ka noqo isbeddelkaagii ugu dambeeyay.','Redo your last undo.'=>'Ku celi wixii aad ugu dambaysay ee aad dib u celisay.','Show or hide the layers panel.'=>'Muuji ama qari guddiga lakabyada.','Display these keyboard shortcuts.'=>'Muuji gaaban-yada kiiboodhkan.','Select a block first.'=>'Markuu hore u dooro baloog.','Style copied. Paste it onto any block, on this site or another.'=>'Qaabka waa la guuriyay. Ku dheji baloog kasta, boggan ama mid kale.','The browser refused to copy.'=>'Barawarku wuu diiday inuu guuriyo.','Section copied. Paste it into any page, on this site or another.'=>'Qeybta waa la koobiyay. Ku dhaji bog kasta, oo ku yaal boggan ama mid kale.','The clipboard does not hold a style copied from Sandwich Studio.'=>'Sabxadda goyntu ma hayso qaab laga soo guuriyay Sandwich Studio.','Style pasted onto %d block.'=>'Qaabka lagu dhejiyay %d baloog.' . "\0" . 'Qaabka waxaa lagu dhejiyay %d baloog.','That style does not fit the selected block.'=>'Habkaas kuma habboona xannibaadda la xulay.','The clipboard does not hold a copied section.'=>'Looxa qoraalka ayaa wada haynin qayb la koobiyay.','Section pasted.'=>'Qaybta la keenay.','Paste style'=>'Ku dhaji qaabka','Paste section'=>'Qeybta dhaji','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Riix Ctrl+V (ama Cmd+V oo ku taal Mac) halkan si aad u dhajiso','Copy style'=>'Nuqulka qaabka','Copy section'=>'Nuqul ka qaado qaybta','Edit in Sandwich Studio'=>'Ku Tasi Sandwich Studio','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'Kaydintu waa guuldarraystay. Hubi xidhiidhkaaga oo dib isku day; isbeddeladaadu waxay ku jiraan biraawsarkan.','Published.'=>'La daabacay.','Saved.'=>'La kaydiyay.','block titleButton link'=>'Isku xirka badhanka','block descriptionA link styled as a button.'=>'Isku xirka loo qaabeeyey sidii badhan oo kale.','block keywordbutton'=>'badhanka','block keywordlink'=>'ku xir','block keywordcall to action'=>'ficirka ficilka','block titleColumn'=>'Tiirka','block descriptionA column inside a row. It can hold any block.'=>'Safka gudihiisa ku jira tiir. Wuxuu xambaari karaa baloog kasta.','block keywordcolumn'=>'safka','block keywordlayout'=>'Qaab-dhismeedka','block titleLanguage switcher (sample)'=>'Badalka luqadda (muunad)','block descriptionLists the site\'s languages from the translation plugin, when one is active. It renders nothing otherwise.'=>'Wuxuu soo bandhigayaa luqadaha mareegaha ee laga helayo qalabka turjumaadda, marka uu mid ka mid ahi shaqeeyo. Haddii kale waxba ma soo bandhigayo.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Luqad','block keywordswitcher'=>'kala beddelaha','block titleSample content'=>'Nuxurka tusaalaha','block descriptionA heading and a paragraph, rendered with neutral class names. It is the reference block for the translation contract.'=>'Cinwaan iyo baaragaraaf, oo lagu soo bandhigay magacyo fasal oo caadi ah. Waa blogga tixraaca ee heshiiska tarjumaadda.','block keywordsample'=>'muunad','block keywordtext'=>'qoraal','block titleIcon'=>'Astaamaha','block descriptionAn SVG icon. The markup is cleaned before it is shown.'=>'Calaamad SVG ah. Qoraalka calaamadaynta waxaa la nadiifiyaa ka hor intaan la soo bandhigin.','block keywordicon'=>'Astaanta','block keywordsvg'=>'svg','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Beddelaha luqadda','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another language, styled to match your page. Needs the Tranzly plugin for the languages.'=>'U oggolaadaa booqashooyinka inay boggan ku akhriyaan luqad kale, oo loo habeeyay inay la mid tahay boggaaga. Waxay u baahan tahay furaha Tranzly ee luqadaha.','block keywordtranslation'=>'turjumid','block keywordmultilingual'=>'badbaado badan','block titleRow'=>'Saf','block descriptionA row of columns. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Safafka tiirarka ah. Wuxuu ahaadaa mid la akhrin karo haddii qalabka dheeriga ah la damiyo.','block keywordrow'=>'safaf','block keywordcolumns'=>'tiirarka','block titleShortcode (add-on)'=>'Gaabiyaha (ku-dar)','block descriptionA shortcode from an add-on written for the classic Page Builder Sandwich editor, with the settings the add-on declared.'=>'Gaabane (shortcode) oo ka yimid lifaaq loogu talagalay tafatiraha classic Page Builder Sandwich, oo wata dejinta uu lifaaqu caddeeyay.','block keywordshortcode'=>'shortcode','block keywordadd-on'=>'dheeraad ah','block titleWidget area'=>'Goobta wiijiga','block descriptionShows the widgets in one of the theme\'s widget areas.'=>'Wuxuu muujinayaa widget-yada mid ka mid ah meelaha widget-ka ee mawduuca.','block keywordsidebar'=>'garabka dhinaca','block keywordwidget area'=>'agagaarka widget-ka','block titleWidget'=>'Widget','block descriptionShows one of the site\'s registered classic widgets.'=>'Waxay soo bandhigaysaa mid ka mid ah agabka kala duwan ee classic-ga ah ee barta diiwaangashan.','block keywordwidget'=>'qalabka yaryar']];